; M2b - diagnosi: nome con escape, CD /, symlink
FailAt 21
Set O NGNFS:build/m2b-out.txt
Delete NGNFS:build/nfs-handler.log $O QUIET >NIL:
Mount NGNFS:test/m2/NFS0 >$O
Wait 1
Echo "== List (symlink come dir?)" >>$O
List NAS: >>$O
Echo "== Type escape" >>$O
Type "NAS:%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%AC.txt" >>$O
Echo "== CD" >>$O
CD NAS:dir1/sub
CD >>$O
CD /
CD >>$O
CD SYS:
Echo "== Dismount" >>$O
NGNFS:build/os3/NFSDismount NFS0: >>$O
Echo "== FINE" >>$O
